WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:02.240
- So, in the context of this whole

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:04.720
Matt Gaetz fiasco, scandal,

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:06.120
a lot of people have been pointing out

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:07.760
that the age of consent is not the same

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:09.240
in all of the US states.

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:11.640
And that is true, there are
a number of American States

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:14.600
where the age of consent is less than 18,

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:16.770
but Florida is not one of those States.

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:20.400
In Florida, under Florida Statute 794.05,

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.140
the age of consent is still 18.

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:24.440
So, it looks like Matt Gaetz

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:26.420
continues to be in hot water,

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:28.943
and it looks like we
will see him in court.

